.3562999119422, 8642.482117914347], "id": 22, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.32.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 14, "widgets_values_named": {"lora_name": "pika_h3_flex_turbo_8step_hd_ref2va.safetensors", "strength_model": 1}}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [43], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "links": [], "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#4b5563", "widgets_values": ["For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: The video is a serene ancient Chinese aesthetic portrait, 9:16 vertical, cinematic soft morning side-back light, shallow depth of field, ethereal air. A young woman in a pale lavender embroidered Hanfu — sheer lavender-and-white wide-sleeve robe over a floral-embroidered ruqun, pearl strands, white flower crown and pearl hairpin with pink-purple tassel drops, long jade drop earrings — stands by a wooden lattice window beside blooming white spring blossoms. [Shot 1] Medium close-up: she holds the reference pose, lowers her eyes for a beat, then slowly lifts her gaze toward the camera; a soft breeze stirs one strand of hair beside her cheek, and her tassel hairpin sways gently; the camera pushes in very slowly. [Shot 2] At 00:02.200, the camera cuts to a medium shot as she turns her body slightly sideways, her sheer wide sleeves lifting and flowing outward in the breeze, and she glances back over her shoulder toward the lens; the camera drifts sideways following the turn. [Shot 3] At 00:04.400, the camera cuts to a close-up: her hand rises to a drooping white blossom branch, her fingertips lightly brush a petal, her lashes lower, and one petal detaches and drifts slowly past her face; blossoms blur softly behind her. [Shot 4] At 00:06.200, the camera cuts to a fuller medium shot beneath the flower tree; wind lifts her sleeves, hair ornaments and loose strands together, she tilts her face up and closes her eyes to feel the breeze, and a soft beam of sunlight filters through the blossoms across her face; the camera slowly pulls back and drifts half a circle. Continuity locked: same pale lavender Hanfu and embroidery, same white-flower-and-pearl hair ornaments with pink-purple tassels, jade drop earrings, warm morning side-back light, wooden lattice window and white blossoming courtyard in every shot.\n\noverall_soundscape: quiet morning courtyard ambience, soft wind rustling through blossom branches, distant faint birdsong, the almost inaudible rustle of sheer silk fabric moving.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: gentle ancient Chinese instrumental, slow guzheng melody over a low bamboo flute pad, ethereal and soothing, no vocals, no percussion.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(0,0,0,0)", "size": [570, 350], "pos": [-1444.5988131773445, 8337.586309352857], "id": 23, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 10, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: The video is a serene ancient Chinese aesthetic portrait, 9:16 vertical, cinematic soft morning side-back light, shallow depth of field, ethereal air. A young woman in a pale lavender embroidered Hanfu — sheer lavender-and-white wide-sleeve robe over a floral-embroidered